### Get all notes
GET http://localhost:5001/api/notes
Content-Type: application/json

### Get single note by ID (replace NOTE_ID with actual ID)
GET http://localhost:5001/api/notes/NOTE_ID
Content-Type: application/json

### Create a new note
POST http://localhost:5001/api/notes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test Note from HTTP Client",
  "content": "This is a test note created using the HTTP test file."
}

### Update a note (replace NOTE_ID with actual ID)
PUT http://localhost:5001/api/notes/NOTE_ID
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated Title",
  "content": "Updated content..."
}

### Delete a note (replace NOTE_ID with actual ID)
DELETE http://localhost:5001/api/notes/NOTE_ID
